SUMMARY:2788 - Taco Night Fiesta
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Sophia Dickmeyer for a fun hands-on class celebrating bold flavors and summer favorites inspired by classic street-style tacos and refreshing seasonal dishes. Guests will learn techniques for preparing flavorful fillings\, fresh toppings\, and homemade tortillas perfect for casual entertaining and warm-weather gatherings. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. * Gluten Free \n• Watermelon Agua Fresca\n• Tortillas from Scratch\n• Shrimp Tacos with Avocado Crema\n• Chorizo Tacos with Pico de Gallo\n• Street Corn Salad
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2788-taco-night-fiesta/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 1180 Erbs Quarry Road\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Gluten Free,Seasonal,Southern
