SUMMARY:2789 - Date Night: Coastal Summer Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Escape to the coast for an elegant evening of fresh summer flavors and elevated seafood favorites in this hands-on date night class with Chef Joe Hall. Guests will learn techniques for preparing restaurant-inspired dishes perfect for summer entertaining\, special occasions\, and romantic dinners at home. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 18  and up.* Gluten Free Friendly \n• House Made Crab Cakes\n• Sweet Corn Risotto with Fresh Herbs & Asparagus\n• Red Pepper Aioli\n• Peach Melba à la Mode
