SUMMARY:2790 - Art of Summer Fermentation
DESCRIPTION:Join Shawn Borup for a flavorful demonstration and take-home class exploring the basics of fermentation. Guests will learn simple techniques for fermenting vegetables\, creating vibrant homemade condiments\, and safely starting ferments at home. Each guest will prepare items to take home while sampling finished ferments during class. \nDemo & Take Home. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. *Gluten Free. Vegetarian. Dairy Free. \nIncludes samples served with crackers and chips. \n• Cucumber Kimchi\n• Fermented Tomatillo Salsa\n• How to Ferment Store-Bought Salsa
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2790-art-of-summer-fermentation/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 1180 Erbs Quarry Road\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Healthy Eating,Seafood,Vegetarian
