SUMMARY:2791 - Beat the Heat\, Japanese Style
DESCRIPTION:Cool down with Chef Cat Alwine in this refreshing hands-on class inspired by light and flavorful Japanese summer cuisine. Guests will learn techniques for preparing chilled dishes\, vibrant seasonal flavors\, and refreshing accompaniments perfect for warm-weather dining and effortless entertaining. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n• Chilled Dipping Noodles\n• Ponzu Marinated Tomatoes\n• Kani Crab Salad\n• Iced Matcha
