SUMMARY:2792 - Empanadas from Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Sophia Dickmeyer for a hands-on class focused on making homemade empanadas completely from scratch. Guests will learn how to prepare dough\, create flavorful fillings\, and master shaping and sealing techniques while exploring both savory and sweet variations of this beloved pastry. \nHands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. \n\nSun Dried Tomato & Goat Cheese Empanadas\nBeef & Cheese Empanadas\nGuava Empanadas
