SUMMARY:2794 - Carolinas BBQ Masterclass
DESCRIPTION:Explore the bold regional flavors and techniques of Carolina-style Barbecue in this 3 hour barbecue masterclass with Pit master Jeremy Losino.Guests will learn the fundamentals of low-and-slow smoking\, meat preparation\, classic barbecue sauces\, and traditional Southern sides while creating an authentic smokehouse feast. \nPartial Hands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up.*Gluten Free Friendly \n• Pulled Pork BBQ\n• Baby Back Ribs\n• Carolina Coleslaw\n• Eastern Carolina BBQ Sauce\n• Carolina Mustard Sauce
