SUMMARY:2796 - Sourdough Pizza and Fresh Mozzarella
DESCRIPTION:Spend three delicious hours with Chef-Instructor Ret Beiler learning the art of sourdough pizza and fresh mozzarella. This hands-on class will guide you through making naturally fermented pizza dough and stretching fresh mozzarella from curd – then bring it all together as you enjoy your handcrafted creations hot from the oven. \nPartial Hands on. BYOB. Ages 16 and up. Vegetarian Friendly \n\nNaturally Fermented Sourdough Pizza Dough\nHand-Stretched Fresh Mozzarella\nPersonalized Sourdough Pizzas with Seasonal Toppings
