DESCRIPTION:Gather for a charming hands-on brunch class filled with elegant morning favorites\, fresh seasonal flavors\, and classic brunch techniques led by our Chef Sophia Dickmyer. Guests will create beautiful dishes perfect for hosting brunch gatherings\, celebrations\, and relaxed weekend mornings with friends. \nHands on. BYOB Sparkling Wine for Mimosas. Ages 18 and up. \n• Ham and Cheese Popovers\n• Market Greens with Classic Dijon Vinaigrette\n• Macerated Strawberries and Pastry Cream\n• Orange Juice/Mimosa Bar
